  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "We substitute the given options in the equation and solve using BODMAS rule:\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8a6f93b0f8305d496162d41f65450f13e20c650df2dbe481929271174df469e9.png] \n\nOption 1) 11 and 3\n\n__**24 ÷ 3**__ + 6 × 11 - 18 = 19\n\n8 + __**6**____** × 11**__ - 18 = 19\n\n__**8 + 66**__ - 18 = 19\n\n__**74 - 18**__ = 19\n\n56 ≠ 19\n\nOption 2) 24 and 18\n__**18 ÷ 3**__ + 11 × 6 - 24 = 19\n\n6 + __**11 × 6**__ - 24 = 19\n\n__**6 + 66**__ - 24 = 19\n\n__**72 - 24**__ = 19\n\n48 ≠ 19\n\nOption 3) 3 and 18\n__**24 ÷ 18**__ + 11 × 6 - 3 = 19\n\n1.3 + __**11 × 6**__ - 3 = 19\n\n__**1.3 + 66**__ - 3 = 19\n\n__**67.3 - 3**__ = 19\n\n64.3 ≠ 19\n\nOption 4) 3 and 6\n__**24 ÷ 6**__ + 11 × 3 - 18 = 19\n\n4 + __**11 × 3**__ - 18 = 19\n\n__**4 + 33**__ - 18 = 19\n\n__**37 - 18**__ = 19\n\n19 = 19\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 4)**",
